Request — 參數：decision (\"allow\" 或 \"deny\")。核准或拒絕待處理的工具權限。\n• 動態變數：{{initialConversationContext}} — 啟動時接收工作階段歷史和上下文。\n\n代理充當使用者和編碼代理之間的語音橋梁。它應該簡潔，僅在被呼叫時回應，並在編碼代理完成工作時進行報告。","settingsVoice.promptGuideTitle":"代理提示詞指南","settingsVoice.supportSubtitle":"獲取更多語音時間並支持開發","settingsVoice.supportTitle":"升級語音","settingsVoice.usageFooter":"過去 30 天使用的語音時間。免費方案: 20 分鐘。訂閱用戶: 5 小時。每月最多 100 次對話。","settingsVoice.usageLabel":"語音時間","settingsVoice.usageTitle":"使用量（過去 30 天）","settingsVoice.usageUsed":{"t":"已使用 ${used}，共 ${limit}"},"sideChat.close":"關閉側邊聊天","sideChat.composerPlaceholder":"傳送訊息到側邊聊天…","sideChat.creating":"正在開始側邊聊天…","sideChat.emptySubtitle":"在一旁向智能體提問。它會繼承此聊天的上下文，但保持獨立——這裡的任何操作都不會影響主對話。","sideChat.emptyTitle":"開始側邊聊天","sideChat.expand":"全螢幕開啟","sideChat.newChat":"新增側邊聊天","sideChat.panelTitle":"側邊聊天","sideChat.startButton":"開始側邊聊天","sideChat.tabLabel":{"t":"側邊聊天 ${index}"},"sideChat.unavailable":"此工作階段暫時無法開始側邊聊天——請等待智能體上線。","sidebar.bots":"機器人","sidebar.hideArchived":"隱藏已封存","sidebar.newSession":"新建對話","sidebar.projects":"專案","sidebar.sessionsTitle":"Happy","sidebar.showAllWorkspaces":{"t":"顯示全部 ${count} 個工作區"},"sidebar.showArchived":"顯示已封存","sidebar.showFewerWorkspaces":"收合","status.activeNow":"目前活躍","status.connected":"已連線","status.connecting":"連線中","status.disconnected":"已中斷連線","status.error":"錯誤","status.inputRequired":"等待你的回答","status.lastSeen":{"t":"最後活躍時間 ${time}"},"status.offline":"離線","status.online":"線上","status.permissionRequired":"需要權限","status.unknown":"未知","status.unread":"新結果","tabs.inbox":"收件匣","tabs.sessions":"工作階段","tabs.settings":"設定","terminal.acceptConnection":"接受連線","terminal.clientSideProcessing":"用戶端處理","terminal.connectTerminal":"連線終端","terminal.connecting":"連線中...","terminal.connectionDetails":"連線詳情","terminal.encryption":"加密","terminal.endToEndEncrypted":"端對端加密","terminal.invalidConnectionLink":"無效的連線連結","terminal.invalidConnectionLinkDescription":"連線連結缺失或無效。請檢查 URL 並重試。","terminal.linkProcessedLocally":"連結在瀏覽器中本機處理","terminal.linkProcessedOnDevi